---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<p class="tnote"><span class="ic"><Icon name="graduation-cap" /></span><span><strong>Teaching or coming to work in Portugal?</strong> <span class="tn-long">Some employers handle some of these steps, and some steps stay with you. Read on for how the process works, and ask your HR department which steps they handle.</span><span class="tn-short">Some employers handle some of these steps. Ask your HR department which ones.</span></span></p>
<style is:global>
  .tnote { display:flex; gap:.8rem; align-items:flex-start; background:var(--green-soft); color:var(--ink); border-radius:16px; padding:.8rem 1rem; margin:.8rem 0; font-size:.95rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .tnote .ic { display:grid; place-items:center; flex:none; width:2.2rem; height:2.2rem; border-radius:50%; background:var(--surface); color:var(--green); } .tnote .ic .i { --s:1.2rem; }
</style>
